    "title": "Best Legal Practice Management Tools for Virtual Assistants",
    "metaTitle": "Legal Practice Management Tools for VAs",
    "description": "A clear guide to legal practice management tools for VAs, including access, task ownership, document workflows, billing support, and security questions.",
    "excerpt": "Choose legal software around the firm's workflow and access model, not around a generic list of popular tools.",
    "topic": "legal",
    "clusterLabel": "Law Firm Virtual Assistant",
    "serviceSlug": "law-firm-virtual-assistant",
