    "metaTitle": "How to Hire a Mental Health VA | Philippines Guide",
    "description": "A step-by-step guide to hiring a mental health virtual assistant in the Philippines, from role design and screening to interviews, onboarding, and access controls.",
    "excerpt": "Build a clearer mental health role, screen for evidence, interview with real scenarios, and onboard without creating a second full-time job for yourself.",
