        "answer": "For teams delegating budget tracking, day-to-day work should come from a defined queue rather than random requests. For this Google Ads VA role, that may include campaign build support, keyword list maintenance, search-term review, and negative keyword administration. In a Google Ads workflow that includes campaign build support, the VA should know where new work appears, what a finished item looks like, and which exceptions need a manager. When recurring Google Ads work includes keyword list maintenance, the exact daily mix depends on your business, so use the role title as a starting point, not as the complete scope."
