        "answer": "Yes, within a defined scope. Independence in a Google Ads role should grow after the person has shown consistent accuracy and good judgment. Give the VA clear rules for routine campaign build support decisions and a short list of situations that require approval. The goal is not zero communication. The goal is for the VA to run routine Google Ads work without repeated prompting and bring you exceptions with enough context to make a quick decision."
